listing:   the release-2 image from the evidence pack
toolchain: QEMU emulator version 8.2.2 (Debian 1:8.2.2+ds-0ubuntu1.18)
command:   qemu-system-aarch64 -M virt,acpi=off -cpu cortex-a53 -m 256M -nographic -semihosting -kernel Image -dtb robot-release2.dtb -append "robot.cycles=500"
date:      2026-10-10T01:50:29Z
machine:   Linux x86_64, 4 CPUs (cloud build container, a virtual machine)
exit code: 6
note:      exit code 6 = the image refused to arm (expected for this evidence)
hardware:  untested on hardware; run in QEMU (qemu-system-aarch64 -M virt), not on a real robot computer
